-team-principal-roles/10846821/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-db0b6099f8835da075b8edd48c09fa202c2a3b218caad75875a937051f2139b9","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"纽维谈本田F1项目与红牛时代的根本不同","summaryZh":"在F1赛季揭幕战墨尔本站的FIA车队负责人新闻发布会上，传奇设计师阿德里安·纽维的出现引发了多方关注。纽维公开谈论了本田的电池问题，承认作为车队负责人的角色在一定程度上分散了他的设计职责，并略带夸张地表示本田……","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T01:23:18.925Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-17T09:54:08.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-6.motorsport.com/images/amp/2jEDm4z0/s6/honda-power-unit-launch-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":206877,"altZh":"纽维谈本田F1项目与红牛时代的根本不同"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/honda-f1-project-different-red-bull-years/10846813/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-35d8a515260d5058f7d0d7ba333feb161d368f7bb86cc3789903fecdeb91191a","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"奥马尔·萨夫瑙尔暗示可能重返F1，但角色或将不同","summaryZh":"前印度力量、阿斯顿·马丁及阿尔派车队负责人奥马尔·萨夫瑙尔表示，他对重返F1持开放态度，但暗示回归可能不再担任车队领队一职。萨夫瑙尔曾在银石车队（印度力量和赛点时期）领导超过十年，后离开阿斯顿·马丁转投阿尔派担任领队。","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T01:59:21.875Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-17T09:39:14.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-9.motorsport.com/images/amp/63QaamD2/s6/otmar-szafnauer.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":180396,"altZh":"奥马尔·萨夫瑙尔暗示可能重返F1，但角色或将不同"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/otmar-szafnauer-opens-door-to-f1-co